6.jpg?v=92a14a39" length="206383" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/international-sherry-week-2026.jpg?v=92a14a39" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>开胃酒时刻选什么酒：气泡酒、桃红酒与适可而止的艺术</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.18/aperitivo-kaiweijiu-qipaojiu-taohongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.18/aperitivo-kaiweijiu-qipaojiu-taohongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>气泡酒、清爽白酒、桃红酒、苦艾酒（vermouth）与spritz：意式aperitivo该选哪些酒，又如何搭配炸物、橄榄和腌肉冷盘。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-per-l-aperitivo.jpg?v=9a88020c" length="244850" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vini-per-l-aperitivo.jpg?v=9a88020c" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2026年圣马丁酒庄开放日：新酒要在罐边品尝</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.17/shengmading-jiuzhuang-kaifangri-2026-xinjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.17/shengmading-jiuzhuang-kaifangri-2026-xinjiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>11月1日至15日，葡萄酒旅游运动协会的酒庄敞开大门迎接新酒。如何安排行程，该问什么，会遇到什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cantine-aperte-san-martino-2026.jpg?v=765ee004" length="328601" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/cantine-aperte-san-martino-2026.jpg?v=765ee004" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>2026年伯恩济贫院拍卖会：为勃艮第定价的那一槌</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.16/2026-bo-en-jipinyuan-putaojiu-paimai-hui/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.16/2026-bo-en-jipinyuan-putaojiu-paimai-hui/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>指南</category><description>11月15日在伯恩的Halles举行第